ation for a specific period for a specific user. It is used, for example, if an employee is on vacation and someone else needs to take over his or her work schedule for the vacation period.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="DGFilter" EntityType="SFOData.DGFilter" sap:label="Dynamic Group Filter" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>DGFilter</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents filters for a given people pool.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Role Based Permissions</sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="TimeTypeProfile" EntityType="SFOData.TimeTypeProfile" sap:label="Time Profile" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>TimeTypeProfile</Summary><LongDescription>In a time profile, you specify which time types the employee is allowed to take. The time profile is part of an employee's job information.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payroll Time Sheets</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PerGlobalInfoAGO" EntityType="SFOData.PerGlobalInfoAGO" sap:label="Global Information" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WfRequestStep" EntityType="SFOData.WfRequestStep" sap:label="WfRequestStep" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false">