ee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="cust_sexualOrientation1" EntityType="SFOData.cust_sexualOrientation1" sap:label="Sexual Orientation" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Generic Objects</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="CurrencyExchangeRate" EntityType="SFOData.CurrencyExchangeRate" sap:label="Currency Exchange Rate" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>The Currency Exchange Rate</Summary><LongDescription>The entity CurrencyExchangeRate is created to provide information about Currency Conversions in EC. An exchange rate is how much it costs to exchange one source currency for another target currency</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PerGlobalInfoNLD" EntityType="SFOData.PerGlobalInfoNLD" sap:label="Global Information" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="GoalAchievements" EntityType="SFOData.GoalAchievements" sap:label="GoalAchievements" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>SuccessLine's GoalAchievements entity</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents Goals/Objective linked with Achievments.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollecti